  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 719.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 719.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this part is to establish the procedures and criteria under which the owner of proposed sewerage or WWTP may seek waiver relief from specific rules contained in Env-Wq 700 when strict compliance with all rules is not in the best interests of public health, the environment, and WWTP operators.\n\nSource. #10693, eff 10-15-14; ss by #14258, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq700.html"
